    "text": "Etain was a queen of Tara. She was the wife of Eochaid Airem. Ailill framed an illness to draw Etain to him. She did not want to break her marriage. She thought the act would save his life. She said yes to a meet on the hillside. A man who looked just like Ailill came toward her. She gave herself to him. The man was not Ailill. He was Midir, her fairy husband from a former life. Her honor was saved in that way.",
